  "description": "Punished by the gods for having killed her husband in her previous life, Bari is unable to grow old or die. The only way to end the curse is to find her reincarnated ex-husband and remarry him. Upright police officer Hae-An Kang has no recollection of his past life. When Bari appears and demands they get married, Hae-An dismisses her as a stalker. But as his bad luck brings misfortune to his only remaining family, Hae-An has to reconsider his options. Can Bari successfully remarry her ex-husband and end their ill-fated relationship?\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
